{{Quote|You know they commissioned an enormous statue of the Emperor for Senate&mdash;I mean, Imperial Plaza? So far, though, the thing looks more terrifying than majestic.|[[Nils Tenant]]|<ref name="Tark" />}}
The '''Imperial Plaza''' was a large public space that surrounded the [[Imperial Senate Building|Senate Building]] on [[Coruscant]]. Before the rise of [[Darth Sidious|Sheev Palpatine]] from [[Supreme Chancellor]] of the [[Galactic Republic]] to [[Galactic Emperor|ruler]] of the [[Galactic Empire]], that open area was called the '''Senate Plaza''' or the '''Republic Plaza'''. Five years after the [[Proclamation of the New Order|foundation]] of the Empire, there were plans to erect a huge statue of Palpatine on the Imperial Plaza.<ref name="Tark" />

